<title>GERMANY: Audi U.S. six-month sales best in a decade.</title>
<headline>Audi U.S. six-month sales best in a decade.</headline>
<dateline>INGOLSTADT, Germany 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audi AG, a unit of Volkswagen AG, said on Friday its sales in the United States for the first six months of 1997 were the best the carmaker had posted in the last 10 years.</p>
<p>Audi said it sold 17,019 new vehicles in the period from January to June in the United States, up 34 percent from 12,702 vehicles in the 1996 period.</p>
<p>In June alone, Audi said its sales rose 48 percent to about 3,200 vehicles compared with 2,176 vehicles in June 1996.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
